Subject: [PATCH] ntdll/wow64cpu: Rosetta signal handling, XState, foreign-thread fault guard, and WoW64 CS recovery

Consolidated patches:
  - (0020) ntdll: classify macOS faulting threads without reading pthread TLS
subj='ntdll: classify macOS faulting threads without reading pthread TLS'
  - (0033) wow64cpu,ntdll: recover Rosetta 2 32<->64 far-jump CS mismatches
subj='wow64cpu,ntdll: recover Rosetta 2 32<->64 far-jump CS mismatches'
  - (0035) ntdll: fix macOS/Rosetta AVX XState, GS fault loop, privileged MSRs, foreign signals, and RO write faults

